      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;🛑 [YOUR TURN: The Cold Open]&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;-your-turn-the-cold-open&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#-your-turn-the-cold-open&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write 2-3 sentences here.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Explain that the math of Tor has never been &amp;lsquo;broken&amp;rsquo; in the wild. People aren&amp;rsquo;t caught because the encryption failed; they are caught because they were human. Mention &amp;lsquo;Digital Fingerprints&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;The Traffic Correlation Trap&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;the-traffic-correlation-trap&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#the-traffic-correlation-trap&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Tor hides your IP, but it cannot hide &lt;strong&gt;Time&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
